<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Amuthinai</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D97706 0%, #F59E0B 100%);
      padding: 50px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .leaf {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .tagline {
      color: #FDE68A;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .message {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .feature-box {
      background: #F3F4F6;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .feature {
      margin: 15px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-right: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .feature-content {
      flex: 1;
    }
    .feature-title {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    .feature-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #6b7280;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .cta-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FEF3C7 0%, #FDE68A 100%);
      border: 2px solid #F59E0B;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .cta-text {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #92400E;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .cta-subtext {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #92400E;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f9fafb;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .footer-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #6b7280;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #e5e7eb, transparent);
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo">
        <span class="leaf">🍃</span> Amuthinai <span class="leaf">🍃</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tagline">Share Food • Support Communities • Reduce Waste</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <div class="greeting">
        Welcome, {{name}}! 🎉
      </div>
      
      <div class="message">
        We're thrilled to have you join the Amuthinai community! You're now part of a movement that's making a real difference by connecting food donors with those in need while reducing food waste.
      </div>

      <div class="feature-box">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🍲</div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-title">Share Food</div>
            <p class="feature-text">Donate surplus food and help fight hunger in your community</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-title">Volunteer</div>
            <p class="feature-text">Help collect and deliver food to those who need it most</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">❤️</div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-title">Request Food</div>
            <p class="feature-text">Access nutritious meals when you need support</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🏆</div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-title">Earn Karma Points</div>
            <p class="feature-text">Get recognized for your contributions to the community</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="cta-text">🚀 Ready to Get Started?</div>
        <div class="cta-subtext">
          Open the Amuthinai app and complete your profile to start making a difference today!
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="message">
        If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is always here to help. Together, we can create a kinder, more sustainable tomorrow.
      </div>

      <div class="message" style="text-align: center; font-weight: 600; color: #D97706;">
        Thank you for being part of the change! 🙏
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div class="footer-text">
        <strong>Amuthinai</strong> - Share Food • Support Communities • Reduce Waste
      </div>
      <div class="footer-text">
        © {{year}} Amuthinai. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
